# General principles

Follow [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) guardrails. Prefer small, focused changes; match existing patterns in `src/`.

- DRY, SOLID, explicit naming
- Validate inputs at boundaries; never log secrets
- Respect the `src/app/` (Angular DI) vs `src/content-sdk/` (no DI) split
- Keep server-only modules (`express`, `unstorage`, `node:*`) out of anything reachable from `src/main.ts`
- Run `npm run build` and `npm run lint` after substantive edits

